# fast_alt_400_1200_p3: alternate between 400 and 1200 kbps every 3 s, latency 50 ms, packet loss 0%, 120 s. Fast-varying setting for the staleness supplementary experiment: the capacity change period is the same order as the switching block length, no random packet loss.
